<!--
  The six public pages. `/admin` is deliberately absent — it is an internal
  page behind Cloudflare Access, and `robots.txt` disallows it.

  The five real pages. Written by hand because there are five of them and a
  generator would be more code than the file. `app.routes.ts` is the source of
  truth; `src/app/sitemap.spec.ts` fails if a page is added here and not there,
  or the other way round.

  No `hreflang` pair, because both languages are served from the same URL —
  see `shared/seo.ts` for what that costs and what would have to change.
-->
